WEBVTT

1
00:00:21.063 --> 00:00:24.983
Jon! And. uh...

2
00:00:25.067 --> 00:00:27.569
Hi. Mom. Hi. Dad.

3
00:00:27.653 --> 00:00:28.862
I'm Lara.

4
00:00:28.946 --> 00:00:31.740
We... we have a daughter?

5
00:00:31.823 --> 00:00:32.823
Lara...

6
00:00:33.909 --> 00:00:35.786
And Jon. you're back!

7
00:00:35.869 --> 00:00:37.329
It's Jonathan.

8
00:00:37.412 --> 00:00:39.206
And what do you mean I'm back?

9
00:00:39.289 --> 00:00:41.333
I've never been here before in my life.

10
00:00:41.416 --> 00:00:43.085
You were here a month ago.

11
00:00:43.168 --> 00:00:45.003
We saved your father. remember?

12
00:00:46.004 --> 00:00:48.048
What are they talking about. Lara?

13
00:00:48.131 --> 00:00:49.883
I... don't know.

14
00:00:49.967 --> 00:00:50.801
What?

15
00:00:50.884 --> 00:00:52.553
He doesn't remember me.

16
00:00:52.636 --> 00:00:54.805
So. when we changed the future. uh...

17
00:00:54.888 --> 00:00:57.432
We rewrote Jon's entire life.

18
00:01:04.063 --> 00:01:08.944
You know. most people prepare
for a Pentagon inspection.

19
00:01:14.074 --> 00:01:17.536
That's a rather... severe look.
even for you.

20
00:01:17.619 --> 00:01:21.289
Care to catch me up
on your little science project?

21
00:01:21.373 --> 00:01:25.085
It's on a need-to-know-basis.
and you don't need to know.

22
00:01:25.168 --> 00:01:28.422
We're supposed to be partners. remember?

23
00:01:28.505 --> 00:01:32.467
No. Wilson. you work for me. remember?

24
00:01:37.180 --> 00:01:38.682
Hello. Lex.

25
00:01:38.765 --> 00:01:41.393
Uh. Director Waller. you're...

26
00:01:41.476 --> 00:01:43.979
Yes. back in charge.

27
00:01:44.062 --> 00:01:46.857
I guess you work for her now.

28
00:02:11.965 --> 00:02:13.717
So we've already done this?

29
00:02:13.800 --> 00:02:15.969
Just you. Lara wasn't here.

30
00:02:16.053 --> 00:02:18.138
But we're so happy to meet you.

31
00:02:18.221 --> 00:02:20.432
Wait. I didn't exist?

32
00:02:20.515 --> 00:02:22.100
Not technically.

33
00:02:22.184 --> 00:02:24.186
Was I. like. an accident?

34
00:02:24.269 --> 00:02:25.395
Uh...

35
00:02:25.478 --> 00:02:26.480
look. look. look.

36
00:02:26.563 --> 00:02:28.207
If... if things didn't
work out last time...

37
00:02:28.231 --> 00:02:29.691
-They did.
-You saved me.

38
00:02:29.775 --> 00:02:31.443
Stop saying that!

39
00:02:31.526 --> 00:02:32.402
That wasn't me.

40
00:02:32.486 --> 00:02:35.155
It was you. A version of you.

41
00:02:35.238 --> 00:02:37.324
And you coming back
made everything better.

42
00:02:37.406 --> 00:02:39.451
Then why is my future worse?

43
00:02:42.496 --> 00:02:44.289
Beautiful day out. eh?

44
00:02:44.373 --> 00:02:46.083
The weather is pleasant.

45
00:02:47.167 --> 00:02:49.628
So where are we now. Kara?

46
00:02:49.711 --> 00:02:51.338
The sky. over Metropolis.

47
00:02:51.421 --> 00:02:52.464
Headed to Smallville.

48
00:02:52.547 --> 00:02:54.883
No. no. I-I mean. where are we...

49
00:02:54.966 --> 00:02:56.218
with each other?

50
00:02:56.301 --> 00:02:58.345
Are you... I mean. am I...

51
00:03:02.724 --> 00:03:04.518
Hey. did I say something wrong up there?

52
00:03:05.644 --> 00:03:06.770
Jimmy Flamebird.

53
00:03:06.853 --> 00:03:08.105
what do you want?

54
00:03:08.188 --> 00:03:14.403
Uh. I guess I-I-I'd wanna be
a better friend. Kara.

55
00:03:14.486 --> 00:03:16.279
I see. A friend.

56
00:03:17.614 --> 00:03:19.199
Is that all you want?

57
00:03:19.282 --> 00:03:21.785
I-I just wanna be with you.

58
00:03:23.745 --> 00:03:25.122
What do you want?

59
00:03:27.165 --> 00:03:29.292
I want to trust you...

60
00:03:29.376 --> 00:03:31.962
but I am afraid
you will leave me alone again.

61
00:03:32.963 --> 00:03:34.673
Kara. I...

62
00:03:34.756 --> 00:03:36.758
Oh good. you're here.

63
00:03:38.510 --> 00:03:40.887
Kara. Jimmy. this is Lara and Jonathan.

64
00:03:40.971 --> 00:03:42.347
From the future...

65
00:03:42.430 --> 00:03:43.305
again.

66
00:03:43.390 --> 00:03:45.350
Jon. you're back.

67
00:03:45.434 --> 00:03:46.560
He's not that Jon.

68
00:03:46.643 --> 00:03:48.228
He's... new.

69
00:03:48.311 --> 00:03:49.312
Yes.

70
00:03:49.396 --> 00:03:51.314
Do not provoke him.

71
00:03:51.398 --> 00:03:52.441
Understood.

72
00:03:52.524 --> 00:03:54.234
Welcome. new Jon.

73
00:03:54.317 --> 00:03:56.111
It's... Jonathan.

74
00:03:56.194 --> 00:03:57.612
Hey. we should get back on mission.

75
00:03:57.696 --> 00:03:59.865
'Cause that worked out so well
for the last guy.

76
00:03:59.948 --> 00:04:01.199
Uh. what mission?

77
00:04:01.283 --> 00:04:02.743
The mission General Lane gave us.

78
00:04:02.826 --> 00:04:04.870
Wow. Dad just can't stop giving orders.

79
00:04:04.953 --> 00:04:08.749
Well. whatever got you here.
I'm glad to have Superboy back.

80
00:04:08.832 --> 00:04:11.168
Don't call me Superboy.

81
00:04:11.251 --> 00:04:12.419
I'm Superman.

82
00:04:12.502 --> 00:04:15.922
Uh. we already have a Superman.

83
00:04:16.005 --> 00:04:17.132
Do you?

84
00:04:19.009 --> 00:04:20.552
Superman this. Superboy that.

85
00:04:20.635 --> 00:04:24.473
Who wants a super slice
of Pa Kent's world famous...

86
00:04:24.556 --> 00:04:25.557
I'm done with this.

87
00:04:26.892 --> 00:04:28.310
Or there's snickerdoodles.

88
00:04:30.729 --> 00:04:31.938
Jonathan.

89
00:04:32.022 --> 00:04:34.399
I... I know all of this
must be strange for you.

90
00:04:35.025 --> 00:04:36.610
But if you need to talk...

91
00:04:36.693 --> 00:04:38.403
I'm here to listen.

92
00:04:39.446 --> 00:04:41.782
You think we can just
have a heart to heart?

93
00:04:41.865 --> 00:04:43.700
Maybe give me a motivational speech.

94
00:04:43.784 --> 00:04:45.284
promise me a better tomorrow?

95
00:04:45.368 --> 00:04:48.205
You... you think. what.
we're just gonna play catch?

96
00:04:51.750 --> 00:04:54.127
I learned to use my powers
on my own. okay?

97
00:04:54.211 --> 00:04:56.338
I defended the Earth on my own.

98
00:04:56.421 --> 00:04:59.090
Because you weren't there.

99
00:05:00.008 --> 00:05:01.635
No one was there.

100
00:05:04.095 --> 00:05:07.265
I'm not here for you this time. Superman.

101
00:05:08.016 --> 00:05:09.351
Stay out of my way.

102
00:05:11.770 --> 00:05:12.979
Jonathan. wait!

103
00:05:22.656 --> 00:05:24.407
Ah. this again. No.

104
00:05:26.034 --> 00:05:27.034
Stop!

105
00:05:32.624 --> 00:05:33.834
You should try that.

106
00:05:33.917 --> 00:05:35.544
Pa Kent. whoo!

107
00:05:35.627 --> 00:05:37.212
That man can bake.

108
00:05:39.381 --> 00:05:42.092
Hey. don't worry about Jon...

109
00:05:42.175 --> 00:05:44.302
and time loops. okay?

110
00:05:45.512 --> 00:05:47.352
Just tell me why you
and your brother are here.

111
00:05:49.266 --> 00:05:51.433
Our mission is confidential.

112
00:05:51.518 --> 00:05:52.435
Of course it is.

113
00:05:52.519 --> 00:05:54.759
But General Lane sent us back
in time to kill Lex Luthor.

114
00:05:55.522 --> 00:05:56.356
What?

115
00:05:56.439 --> 00:05:59.192
You traveled back in time
to commit murder?

116
00:05:59.276 --> 00:06:00.610
We're here to protect the future.

117
00:06:00.694 --> 00:06:02.946
What kind of future do you come from?

118
00:06:03.029 --> 00:06:04.698
In our time. Luthor commands

119
00:06:04.781 --> 00:06:07.951
a personal army
of mind-controlled Kryptonian clones.

120
00:06:08.034 --> 00:06:09.119
The Eradicators.

121
00:06:09.202 --> 00:06:11.121
There has to be another way to stop him.

122
00:06:11.204 --> 00:06:14.708
You don't have to kill Lex
just because my dad told you to.

123
00:06:14.791 --> 00:06:16.209
Your dad?

124
00:06:16.293 --> 00:06:17.586
Yeah. General Lane.

125
00:06:17.669 --> 00:06:19.671
-That's not who...
-Salt and pepper crewcut.

126
00:06:19.754 --> 00:06:21.047
always giving orders.

127
00:06:21.131 --> 00:06:24.467
No. You told us to kill Lex Luthor.

128
00:06:24.551 --> 00:06:26.094
You're General Lane.

129
00:06:29.264 --> 00:06:33.226
As you can see. Lexcorp
is paving the way to a safer.

130
00:06:33.310 --> 00:06:35.103
more secure Metropolis with...

131
00:06:35.186 --> 00:06:36.271
Save it. Luthor.

132
00:06:38.273 --> 00:06:40.400
Wilson. you're still here.

133
00:06:40.483 --> 00:06:42.819
My apologies. Mr. Luthor.

134
00:06:42.903 --> 00:06:44.821
But why don't you show Director Waller

135
00:06:44.905 --> 00:06:46.531
your latest project?

136
00:06:47.449 --> 00:06:48.533
Ah...

137
00:06:48.617 --> 00:06:51.202
It's still in its infancy.
not ready for review.

138
00:06:51.286 --> 00:06:54.581
-But over here...
-I insist.

139
00:06:55.749 --> 00:06:56.875
Very well.

140
00:06:59.669 --> 00:07:02.881
Director Waller. allow me to present...

141
00:07:04.799 --> 00:07:07.260
Project Eradicator.

142
00:07:08.678 --> 00:07:12.557
Once complete. this weapon
will put humanity back on top

143
00:07:12.641 --> 00:07:15.101
as the world's dominant species.

144
00:07:15.185 --> 00:07:17.812
Created from Superman's own living tissue.

145
00:07:17.896 --> 00:07:20.815
Eradicator self-repairs. self-evolves.

146
00:07:20.899 --> 00:07:25.403
and will function under my
complete direct mental control.

147
00:07:25.487 --> 00:07:27.322
Mental control?

148
00:07:27.405 --> 00:07:29.407
The hardware is not finished.
but once it is.

149
00:07:29.491 --> 00:07:31.701
the Luthor gray matter
I put in Eradicator's brain

150
00:07:31.785 --> 00:07:34.120
will let me control him with mine.

151
00:07:34.204 --> 00:07:38.041
You put a piece of your brain
inside that thing?

152
00:07:38.124 --> 00:07:39.751
That's all I need to see.

153
00:07:39.834 --> 00:07:40.961
Shut it down. Luthor.

154
00:07:41.044 --> 00:07:42.879
Wait. you don't understand.

155
00:07:42.963 --> 00:07:44.798
The Eradicator will revolutionize...

156
00:07:44.881 --> 00:07:47.258
No. you don't understand.

157
00:07:47.342 --> 00:07:49.761
I'm not just shutting down
Project Eradicator.

158
00:07:49.844 --> 00:07:54.182
I'm shutting down all of Lexcorp.
effective immediately.

159
00:07:57.560 --> 00:07:59.396
Welp. I'm a horrible parent.

160
00:07:59.479 --> 00:08:00.397
Me too.

161
00:08:00.480 --> 00:08:01.731
Poor Jonathan.

162
00:08:01.815 --> 00:08:03.984
Jonathan? I'm talking about Lara.

163
00:08:04.067 --> 00:08:07.112
Ugh. you think you're doing
your best as a mother. but...

164
00:08:07.195 --> 00:08:08.395
Well. at least you were there.

165
00:08:08.446 --> 00:08:11.241
I somehow missed our kids' lives
two times in a row.

166
00:08:11.324 --> 00:08:12.575
Maybe that's it.

167
00:08:12.659 --> 00:08:14.202
Maybe I'm the problem.

168
00:08:14.285 --> 00:08:16.997
I'm the reason Lara turned out this way.

169
00:08:17.080 --> 00:08:17.998
Wait. what's wrong with Lara?

170
00:08:18.081 --> 00:08:19.081
Wait.

171
00:08:20.082 --> 00:08:21.751
Where is Lara?

172
00:08:22.502 --> 00:08:23.670
Director Waller.

173
00:08:23.753 --> 00:08:24.587
I... I'm...

174
00:08:24.671 --> 00:08:27.382
I'm working for the good
of humankind here.

175
00:08:27.465 --> 00:08:28.842
Out of my way. Luthor.

176
00:08:30.301 --> 00:08:31.302
You see this?

177
00:08:31.386 --> 00:08:34.054
That's a prototype time travel device.

178
00:08:34.139 --> 00:08:37.100
Imagine what we could do
once it's complete.

179
00:08:37.183 --> 00:08:39.303
You... you'll... you'll be able
to go back to the past

180
00:08:39.352 --> 00:08:41.770
and stop your enemies
before they even strike.

181
00:08:41.855 --> 00:08:43.565
I've made my decision. Luthor.

182
00:08:43.648 --> 00:08:46.317
Listen. I've seen what's out there.

183
00:08:46.401 --> 00:08:48.278
Superman's not even the worst of it.

184
00:08:48.361 --> 00:08:51.614
There are things waiting in space that...

185
00:08:51.698 --> 00:08:55.785
Superman put his life on the line
when we needed him.

186
00:08:55.869 --> 00:08:58.913
I'll take space aliens over you any day.

187
00:08:58.997 --> 00:09:02.876
You've not only failed
to live up to Checkmate's expectations.

188
00:09:02.959 --> 00:09:05.045
you don't even look after your own.

189
00:09:07.589 --> 00:09:09.049
You.

190
00:09:13.845 --> 00:09:15.930
And who is this young lady?

191
00:09:16.014 --> 00:09:17.390
I'm here for Luthor.

192
00:09:18.892 --> 00:09:20.518
No. stop. stop! I'm... I'm... I'm...

193
00:09:21.519 --> 00:09:23.188
I'm just a scientist.

194
00:09:23.271 --> 00:09:24.689
Just a scientist?

195
00:09:26.983 --> 00:09:28.610
You're the end of the world.

196
00:09:55.261 --> 00:09:57.972
Just like Lara
to rush headlong into things.

197
00:09:58.056 --> 00:10:00.642
Always trying to be mommy's
perfect little soldier.

198
00:10:03.436 --> 00:10:04.854
Sorry. kids.

199
00:10:04.938 --> 00:10:05.980
Whole site's locked down.

200
00:10:06.773 --> 00:10:08.691
No one gets past me...

201
00:10:08.775 --> 00:10:12.278
especially Kryptonians.

202
00:10:12.362 --> 00:10:13.738
Where's Lara?

203
00:10:13.822 --> 00:10:17.700
Lara? Is that the super-powered
teenager who tried to kill Lex?

204
00:10:17.784 --> 00:10:19.619
They took the fight underground.

205
00:10:19.702 --> 00:10:20.787
Who's they?

206
00:10:30.338 --> 00:10:31.464
You okay. Smallville?

207
00:10:31.548 --> 00:10:34.008
Yeah. the sewage broke my fall.

208
00:10:34.092 --> 00:10:35.176
Oh. good.

209
00:10:37.887 --> 00:10:39.597
Is Lara down here?

210
00:10:39.681 --> 00:10:41.558
She must be. And the sooner we find her.

211
00:10:41.641 --> 00:10:43.001
the sooner we can get out of here.

212
00:10:44.769 --> 00:10:45.769
Lara?

213
00:11:00.285 --> 00:11:02.221
For a second. I thought
there was a monster down here...

214
00:11:02.245 --> 00:11:05.498
Shh! There is a monster down here.

215
00:11:09.419 --> 00:11:11.921
Kal-El? Lois?

216
00:11:12.005 --> 00:11:14.799
Let's split up. We'll find them
faster that way.

217
00:11:14.883 --> 00:11:16.926
That is unwise. Jonathan.

218
00:11:17.010 --> 00:11:19.012
The lead in this facility
is disrupting the...

219
00:11:19.095 --> 00:11:20.722
Whatever. I don't need your permission.

220
00:11:25.393 --> 00:11:28.855
Kal-El. Lois Lane. can you hear me?

221
00:11:33.401 --> 00:11:34.861
Jonathan?

222
00:11:47.457 --> 00:11:48.458
-Help!
-Help!

223
00:11:56.758 --> 00:11:58.343
No. no. no. no. no!

224
00:12:00.595 --> 00:12:01.595
Jonathan!

225
00:12:02.388 --> 00:12:03.473
Lara. wait.

226
00:12:08.895 --> 00:12:09.771
Which way?

227
00:12:09.854 --> 00:12:10.980
I-I-I think she went...

228
00:12:17.946 --> 00:12:19.822
Where's my brother?

229
00:12:48.268 --> 00:12:49.268
Lara!

230
00:12:50.353 --> 00:12:51.646
What is that thing?

231
00:12:51.729 --> 00:12:53.147
It's an Eradicator.

232
00:12:53.231 --> 00:12:54.983
But... this one is different.

233
00:12:56.693 --> 00:12:59.070
Back off!

234
00:13:06.244 --> 00:13:07.829
Lara. you're hurt. Get back!

235
00:13:07.912 --> 00:13:09.789
Don't listen to her. Get behind him.

236
00:13:11.207 --> 00:13:12.542
Lara. listen to me.

237
00:13:16.963 --> 00:13:18.256
No!

238
00:13:28.766 --> 00:13:32.520
Stay away from my family.

239
00:14:05.762 --> 00:14:07.555
Kids. wait!

240
00:14:07.638 --> 00:14:10.641
Our children... are so disrespectful.

241
00:14:11.267 --> 00:14:12.602
Come on. this way.

242
00:14:14.354 --> 00:14:16.689
Bring your monster to heel. Luthor.

243
00:14:16.773 --> 00:14:20.026
I... I... I can't stop it.

244
00:14:20.109 --> 00:14:21.778
Don't you two share a brain?

245
00:14:22.862 --> 00:14:26.240
What happened to "direct mental control?"

246
00:14:26.324 --> 00:14:29.535
I already told you.
the system is incomplete.

247
00:14:29.619 --> 00:14:31.579
It won't respond to my commands.

248
00:14:33.247 --> 00:14:34.999
Eradicator's in control.

249
00:14:49.180 --> 00:14:50.223
Lara!

250
00:14:59.941 --> 00:15:01.776
Lara! Lara!

251
00:15:05.571 --> 00:15:07.949
I am your opponent.

252
00:15:42.066 --> 00:15:44.068
He's evolving too fast for us.

253
00:15:44.152 --> 00:15:46.529
We've... we've lost.

254
00:15:47.655 --> 00:15:49.991
Just like that other Jonathan.

255
00:15:50.074 --> 00:15:52.201
There's... there's nothing we can do.

256
00:15:52.285 --> 00:15:53.453
Ow!

257
00:15:53.536 --> 00:15:54.536
You are not the only one

258
00:15:54.579 --> 00:15:56.706
who has seen a different world. Jonathan.

259
00:15:56.789 --> 00:15:59.542
I have seen other futures.

260
00:15:59.625 --> 00:16:02.503
We can still choose a better tomorrow.

261
00:16:08.926 --> 00:16:10.011
Stay here.

262
00:16:10.094 --> 00:16:11.554
I'll show you.

263
00:16:23.691 --> 00:16:25.151
She's alone with that thing.

264
00:16:27.361 --> 00:16:28.488
Clark. you can't.

265
00:16:30.198 --> 00:16:31.616
That's a job...

266
00:16:31.699 --> 00:16:32.825
for Superman.

267
00:17:04.147 --> 00:17:05.233
No.

268
00:17:27.255 --> 00:17:29.465
Kara! Kara.

269
00:17:31.217 --> 00:17:32.051
Why?

270
00:17:32.134 --> 00:17:33.134
You...

271
00:17:34.637 --> 00:17:36.389
are my better tomorrow.

272
00:17:50.653 --> 00:17:51.862
Kara!

273
00:17:55.157 --> 00:17:56.157
Jonathan!

274
00:17:59.495 --> 00:18:00.495
What?

275
00:18:04.083 --> 00:18:05.209
Not again.

276
00:18:05.876 --> 00:18:07.211
My family needs me.

277
00:18:08.754 --> 00:18:09.797
They need me.

278
00:18:24.437 --> 00:18:25.521
Enough of this.

279
00:18:59.513 --> 00:19:02.224
You... lose.

280
00:19:11.692 --> 00:19:12.860
Kara!

281
00:19:12.943 --> 00:19:14.153
Kara. please!

282
00:19:16.947 --> 00:19:19.617
I am... too late.

283
00:19:20.368 --> 00:19:21.368
She's not...

284
00:19:22.453 --> 00:19:23.829
She's not waking up.

285
00:19:26.749 --> 00:19:27.792
Jonathan...

286
00:19:30.044 --> 00:19:31.044
Are you okay?

287
00:19:33.714 --> 00:19:35.466
I couldn't stop it.

288
00:19:35.549 --> 00:19:38.761
Eradicator is loose in the time stream.

289
00:19:43.432 --> 00:19:46.143
So. who am I arresting?

290
00:19:46.227 --> 00:19:47.812
What?

291
00:19:47.895 --> 00:19:50.106
We haven't been properly introduced.

292
00:19:50.189 --> 00:19:53.234
Amanda Waller. Pentagon.

293
00:19:53.317 --> 00:19:56.028
Director Waller. the kids
were just following orders.

294
00:19:56.112 --> 00:19:57.422
They were sent here from the future

295
00:19:57.446 --> 00:19:59.907
to stop Lex from unleashing that monster.

296
00:19:59.990 --> 00:20:04.704
Uh... I was defending myself
from an assassination.

297
00:20:04.787 --> 00:20:08.124
The prototype was never meant
to be active at this stage.

298
00:20:08.207 --> 00:20:09.750
It... it's her fault.

299
00:20:09.834 --> 00:20:11.460
That... that... that...

300
00:20:15.840 --> 00:20:17.049
Slade. you tell them.

301
00:20:17.133 --> 00:20:18.134
You saw everything.

302
00:20:18.217 --> 00:20:20.386
You know what I was trying to accomplish.

303
00:20:20.469 --> 00:20:22.179
What we were trying to do.

304
00:20:24.348 --> 00:20:26.684
I tried to tell you. Alex.

305
00:20:28.519 --> 00:20:29.895
Wilson...

306
00:20:29.979 --> 00:20:32.022
book Lex Luthor.

307
00:20:32.106 --> 00:20:35.192
We'll sort out our... new guests later.

308
00:20:37.486 --> 00:20:39.321
What are we gonna do. Clark?

309
00:20:39.405 --> 00:20:40.406
Kara.

310
00:20:40.489 --> 00:20:41.490
the kids.

311
00:20:41.574 --> 00:20:43.117
the monster...

312
00:20:43.200 --> 00:20:44.994
How are we gonna fix this?

313
00:20:45.077 --> 00:20:48.080
I... I think I know where my powers are.

314
00:20:48.164 --> 00:20:49.790
I think I can get them back.

315
00:20:50.916 --> 00:20:52.710
You can bring back Superman?

316
00:20:52.793 --> 00:20:54.336
I think so. but I...

317
00:20:54.420 --> 00:20:55.796
I'll have to leave.

318
00:20:56.881 --> 00:20:58.132
For a little while.

319
00:20:58.215 --> 00:20:59.216
Clark. no.

320
00:20:59.300 --> 00:21:01.027
No. you can't leave me alone
with these kids.

321
00:21:01.051 --> 00:21:03.345
I'll fail them. We know I fail them.

322
00:21:03.429 --> 00:21:06.474
You aren't the person
who sent them here. Lois.

323
00:21:06.557 --> 00:21:07.933
They need the real you.

324
00:21:08.017 --> 00:21:09.017
This you.

325
00:21:09.059 --> 00:21:11.020
But I need you. Clark.

326
00:21:11.103 --> 00:21:13.189
Our whole future is getting ripped away.

327
00:21:13.272 --> 00:21:14.732
First Jon and now...

328
00:21:16.400 --> 00:21:18.861
I'm only going away for a little while.

329
00:21:21.197 --> 00:21:22.448
We can't save the kids.

330
00:21:22.531 --> 00:21:24.909
We... we can't save the future...

331
00:21:24.992 --> 00:21:26.327
without Superman.

332
00:21:33.667 --> 00:21:34.835
Promise me. then.

333
00:21:34.919 --> 00:21:37.463
Promise me. Clark. that you'll come back.

334
00:21:44.512 --> 00:21:46.180
I promise.
